pat='10000010011111111000111101000100100010011111000001000011101011101011011101010001101101111001101010010100110100101000000100001101100101010011111101111000001100011110011011101001001000010110001011000000'
comp=''.join('0' if c=='1' else '1' for c in pat)
class D48:
 def __init__(self,state=0): self.s=state
 def val(self):
  self.s=(0x5DEECE66D*self.s+0xB)&((1<<48)-1); return self.s/(1<<48)
def stream(state,n=5000):
 d=D48(state); return [d.val() for _ in range(n)]
def bits(vals,ge=True): return ''.join('1' if (v>=.5)==ge else '0' for v in vals)
states={'default0':0}
for seed in [0,1,11,42,100,5489,12345]:
 states[f'srand48({seed})']=((seed & 0xffffffff)<<16)|0x330e
for name,st in states.items():
 vals=stream(st)
 for ge in [True,False]:
  b=bits(vals,ge)
  for label,p in [('same',pat),('comp',comp)]:
   i=b.find(p)
   if i>=0: print('FOUND substring',name,ge,label,i)
  for stride in range(2,11):
   for off in range(stride):
    bb=b[off::stride]
    if bb[:200]==pat: print('FOUND stride',name,ge,stride,off,'same')
    if bb[:200]==comp: print('FOUND stride',name,ge,stride,off,'comp')
print('done')
# also lowbit of lrand48: state>>17? lrand48 returns state>>17 (31 bits) after update; low bit is bit17 of state. generate states
def states_stream(state,n=5000):
 s=state; out=[]
 for _ in range(n):
  s=(0x5DEECE66D*s+0xB)&((1<<48)-1); out.append(s)
 return out
for name,st in states.items():
 ss=states_stream(st)
 for bit in [0,1,16,17,31,47]:
  b=''.join('1' if (x>>bit)&1 else '0' for x in ss)
  if pat in b or comp in b: print('found state bit',name,bit,b.find(pat),b.find(comp))
  for stride in range(2,6):
   for off in range(stride):
    if b[off::stride][:200] in (pat,comp): print('found state bit stride',name,bit,stride,off)
print('done2')
